{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goofy Golfette: </strong>Crazy golf-kart <strong>battles</strong> in a chaotic <strong>score race</strong> ! Blast your way  to victory\u00a0(and maybe a few friendships)  with <strong>nitro</strong>-fueled <strong>dashes</strong>, charged shots, and unique golf-cart <strong>skills</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udcaf<u> SCORE </u>\ud83d\udcaf</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, score the most points and for that you will have to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blow up</strong> your friends <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">(nicely huh)</span></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put balls in <strong>holes</strong> <i>(the real objective of golf, it seems)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dying <i>(it\u2019s better, but not mandatory.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/0e21a119c85065c74a55a9d1c6fb0049.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/0e21a119c85065c74a55a9d1c6fb0049.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/0e21a119c85065c74a55a9d1c6fb0049.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25<u> NITRO, <i>baby! </i></u>\ud83d\udd25</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reap chaos, you will need <u>NITROOO</u>\u00a0!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>pick them up</strong> on the map or collect it by putting <strong>balls in holes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Nitro is the hot sauce of your golf cart: without it, you won't last long.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/136e349af595363ef450b33b8823b882.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/136e349af595363ef450b33b8823b882.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/136e349af595363ef450b33b8823b882.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udca5<u> ACTION <i>(and r\u00e9actions) </i></u>\ud83d\udca5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With some Nitro, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash</strong> to avoid projectiles <i>(or just to show off)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot <strong>Charged Balls</strong> at others</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/27ad3fed55e50be6bb70df7115e0d5db.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/27ad3fed55e50be6bb70df7115e0d5db.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/27ad3fed55e50be6bb70df7115e0d5db.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\ude35<u> BAM, DAZED !\u00a0</u>\ud83d\ude35</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run into an <u>obstacle</u> or a well-placed <u>ball</u> ? Result : <strong>dazed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your &quot;Racing car&quot; slows like a turtle, and the <strong><u>wave of fire</u></strong> behind you is already catching up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/13b047457a1bcfc0825ab7992645cf29.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/13b047457a1bcfc0825ab7992645cf29.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/13b047457a1bcfc0825ab7992645cf29.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc6<u> PROGRESSION : <i>style above all\u00a0</i></u>\ud83c\udfc6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing like a boss, you will unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Golf-karts</strong> with <u>unique</u> skills</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 Wacky maps</strong> full of <u>surprises</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Klaxons</strong> that make you <u>laugh</u> <i>(or not ..)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 Slamming Skins</strong> <i>(because swag is important)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, ready to burn the grass, humiliate your friends and <i>(potentially)</i> play golf?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on, put this game on your <strong>WISHLIST</strong> and you\u2019ll be notified as soon as it\u2019s ready!!\u00a0<strong><i><u>(december 2025)</u></i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828880?t=1769502871","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/ea06fa3bf2510a8f8c1eb05f3d4ba0d08843a211/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769502871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/6477a5a0f3cb9dc97b3c90c53eba7bd9a846f59c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769502871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/6477a5a0f3cb9dc97b3c90c53eba7bd9a846f59c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769502871","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goofy Golfette: </strong>Crazy golf-kart <strong>battles</strong> in a chaotic <st