g.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/136e349af595363ef450b33b8823b882.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/136e349af595363ef450b33b8823b882.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/136e349af595363ef450b33b8823b882.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udca5<u> ACTION <i>(and r\u00e9actions) </i></u>\ud83d\udca5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With some Nitro, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash</strong> to avoid projectiles <i>(or just to show off)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot <strong>Charged Balls</strong> at others</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/27ad3fed55e50be6bb70df7115e0d5db.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/27ad3fed55e50be6bb70df7115e0d5db.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/27ad3fed55e50be6bb70df7115e0d5db.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\ude35<u> BAM, DAZED !\u00a0</u>\ud83d\ude35</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run into an <u>obstacle</u> or a well